				<p class="pDate"><font size="1" face="MS Sans Serif, Verdana, Arial"><b>Monday, June 19, 2000</b></font>
				<p><b><font face="MS Sans Serif, Verdana, Arial" size="2" color="#990000">Guild Event <br></font></b>
				<font face="MS Sans Serif, Verdana, Arial" size="2">Hear Ye! Hear Ye what the Draken and Elder
Dragons have to tell!<br><br>On the 21st of this month the two guilds "Draken" and "Elder Dragons" have planned a great event in the forest of Faydark to celebrate the first birthday of both guilds. So we invite every brave adventurer who is willing to join our peaceful party.<br><br>
The party will start at 9 a.m. (PST) at the
wizard gate near Felwithe. You will find there a exquisite meal to everyone of you and beside this we planned for the young adventurers (level 1-9) of you a special challenge to
award the brave warrior who knows Faydwer best.
<br><br>We hope to have a lot of guests who will celebrate the first birthday of these two guilds with us.
<br><br>
( Important: Because both guilds are German
speaking only guilds we decide to use this language mainly on this event. This makes it easier for some of our members who are not too good in English. But of course we have some members who have no problems with the English language. So they will translate it roughly and as good as they can. The challenge is planned in German but we
translate it in English as well if demanded so that every one has the possibility to take action in it. I hope
everyone will be satisfied with it)<br><br>
May Tunare watch you                     <br><br>Barthalo Edhelorn<br>Dragon Master of the Elder Dragons
<br>
<BR> - Balthor<BR><BR>
				<hr noshade size="1"></Font>
			
				<p class="pDate"><font size="1" face="MS Sans Serif, Verdana, Arial"><b>Sunday, June 18, 2000</b></font>
				<p><b><font face="MS Sans Serif, Verdana, Arial" size="2" color="#990000">Wedding <br></font></b>
				<font face="MS Sans Serif, Verdana, Arial" size="2">Mercyon Sunstrider and I shall be getting married this Tuesday at 9pm est in Autumn Valley of dreadlands where the teleports are. All are invited who wish to go and celebrate this happy occasion with us or to go and make fun of the priest Karek =). Theree will be lots of booze to go around. =)<br><br>

Davan Dragonsbane<br>
Heroes of the Seven Suns<br><BR> - Anumatu<BR><BR>
				<hr noshade size="1"></Font>
			
				<p class="pDate"><font size="1" face="MS Sans Serif, Verdana, Arial"><b>Sunday, February 06, 2000</b></font>
				<p><b><font face="MS Sans Serif, Verdana, Arial" size="2" color="#990000">Halfings Unite <br></font></b>
				<font face="MS Sans Serif, Verdana, Arial" size="2">"Boombrakh Growli is leading a small but growing force of halflings called 'The Protectors of Rivervale'. Are you a Halfling and proud of it? Would you like to protect the innocent from the growing threat from the Runny Eye Goblins, then sign up, mail Boombrakh at <a href=mailto:boombrakh@telia.com>boombrakh@telia.com</a> and tell him you want in! With your help Boombrakh will make this force official but he needs your support, make his dream for a better Rivervale come true!"

<BR> - Boombrakh Growli<BR><BR>
				<hr noshade size="1"></Font>
			
				<p class="pDate"><font size="1" face="MS Sans Serif, Verdana, Arial"><b>Thursday, September 16, 1999</b></font>
				<p><b><font face="MS Sans Serif, Verdana, Arial" size="2" color="#990000">Sand Giant Hunting <br></font></b>
				<font face="MS Sans Serif, Verdana, Arial" size="2">On 9/18/99 This event is happening:<BR> <BR>

The filthy sand giants have slaughtered our people for too long! Come one, come all, to the Northern Desert of Ro and let us kill one of these abominations! We will share in the loot, and celebrate our victory (or mourn our loss) in the taverns of Freeport. Levels 20 and under. I realize this is a big risk, and I call upon everyone to prove themselves! 

<BR><BR>
Kiratesl
<BR>
<BR> - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
